        "thought_text": "Thought-2: Implement a more efficient algorithm using a geometric approach to find the maximum number of intersected fruits. Specifically, use a line sweeping technique along with a balanced binary search tree to keep track of the fruits that are currently intersected by the line as it sweeps across the plane. This approach will significantly reduce the time complexity compared to the brute-force method.",
